36985>>>>>    
36985>>>>>    //
36985>>>>>    // This procedure is called when validating a session and after logging in. Its purpose is to 
36985>>>>>    // update properties based on the session and user data. Augment this function to update 
36985>>>>>    // properties based on the session / user table. Note that WebAppUser and WebAppSession contain
36985>>>>>    // the right records when this procedure is called.
36985>>>>>    //
36985>>>>>    // Params:
36985>>>>>    //      bClear   True if the procedure is called before session validation to clear properties.
36985>>>>>    //
36985>>>>>    Procedure UpdateSessionProperties Boolean bClear
36987>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
36987>>>>>        
36987>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
36988>>>>>        
36988>>>>>        //  Update user properties
36988>>>>>        If (not(bClear) and HasRecord(hoUserDD)) Begin
36990>>>>>            Set psUsername to (Trim(WebAppUser.FullName))
36991>>>>>            Set psLoginName to (Trim(WebAppUser.LoginName))
36992>>>>>            Set piUserRights to WebAppUser.Rights
36993>>>>>            
36993>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesSet 
36994>>>>>        End
36994>>>>>>
36994>>>>>        Else Begin
36995>>>>>            Set psUsername to ""
36996>>>>>            Set psLoginName to ""
36997>>>>>            Set piUserRights to 0
36998>>>>>            
36998>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesClear
36999>>>>>        End
36999>>>>>>
36999>>>>>    End_Procedure
37000>>>>>    
37000>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesSet
37002>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37002>>>>>    End_Procedure
37003>>>>>    
37003>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesClear
37005>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37005>>>>>    End_Procedure
37006>>>>>    
