37009>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37010>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37012>>>>>            Forward Send EndSession
37014>>>>>            Procedure_Return
37015>>>>>        End
37015>>>>>>
37015>>>>>            
37015>>>>>        //  Check if session exists
37015>>>>>        Send Clear of hoSessionDD
37016>>>>>        Get psSessionKey to WebAppSession.SessionKey
37017>>>>>        
37017>>>>>        Send Find of hoSessionDD EQ Index.1
37018>>>>>        If (Found) Begin
37020>>>>>            Set Field_Changed_Value of hoSessionDD Field WebAppSession.Active to "N"
37021>>>>>            Get Request_Validate of hoSessionDD to iErr
37022>>>>>            If (iErr) Begin
37024>>>>>                // this should not happen. If it does its a programming error
37024>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$WebAppSessionValidateFailed
37025>>>>>>
37025>>>>>                Procedure_Return
37026>>>>>            End
37026>>>>>>
37026>>>>>            Send Request_Save of hoSessionDD
37027>>>>>        End
37027>>>>>>
37027>>>>>    End_Procedure
