38168>            Procedure OnUpdateViewStack
38171>                Handle hoTop hoDflt
38171>                Integer eMode
38171>                Boolean bTop
38171>                
38171>                WebGet peMode of (Owner(Self)) to eMode
38172>                
38172>                Get TopViewHandle of oViewStack to hoTop
38173>                Get GetDefaultView to hoDflt
38174>                Move (hoTop=0 or hoTop=hoDflt) to bTop
38175>                
38175>                WebSet pbRender of oBackButton to (not(bTop) and eMode >= rmMobile)
38176>                WebSet pbRender of oMenuButton to (bTop or eMode < rmMobile)
38177>            End_Procedure
